/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T15:07:53Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T15:09:03Z","body":"> However, I think it's fine to make this change since they're not exactly failure status codes, so we may as well be more forgiving. The only thing I would want is to at least log it somewhere (at least when verbose logging is enabled).\r\n\r\nAppreciate it, I'll look into logging practices for that part of Godot. This is a near-trivial PR, so no hard feelings on my side if it gets turned down anyway.\r\n\r\nI'll also look at the GDExtension-Sharp or whatever the official name is, last time I checked it lagged behind too much to be viable. I do believe that would be \"the future\", and should work with basic libgodot.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828687231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]